9s turning into a giant metallic duck, speccing into turretmancy, or literal poison, every game will present you with freshly randomized build combos to gamba with. Build synergies, get winnergies.   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/2fb0bdc9800eb97df3ebdfdd4fd84672.poster.avif?t=1759970780\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/2fb0bdc9800eb97df3ebdfdd4fd84672.webm?t=1759970780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/2fb0bdc9800eb97df3ebdfdd4fd84672.mp4?t=1759970780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/29fad5af76808dfc67e867339e5fdd92.avif?t=1759970780\" width=800 height=157 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block escape routes with a crane\u2019s payload, transform into a vending machine for a sneaky ambush, or do a drive-by in a 1942 Panzerkampfwagon Tiger Tank. BAPBAP is a PvP sandbox where nothing make sense but also everything makes sense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/df2e4f10e587d738484ff71bf43e7b7b.poster.avif?t=1759970780\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/df2e4f10e587d738484ff71bf43e7b7b.webm?t=1759970780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/df2e4f10e587d738484ff71bf43e7b7b.mp4?t=1759970780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/5f81d1318c7c39389ed8138510e65157.avif?t=1759970780\" width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of all that, you could get ganked by a roaming giga slime, fish up a nuclear bomb or come face to tentacle with [redacted]\u00a0 - the better you are at adapting, the more you\u2019ll win.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/98d55484844c609cdb54523f49f10dfa.poster.avif?t=1759970780\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/98d55484844c609cdb54523f49f10dfa.webm?t=1759970780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/98d55484844c609cdb54523f49f10dfa.mp4?t=1759970780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/67e45e011dddb8ce98e86cbfb4f22339.avif?t=1759970780\" width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether it\u2019s the turnaround 1v3, hitting a sweet multi-target knock up or just watching your mates get hit by their own trap \u2013 BAPBAP is here to help you get that sweet hit of dopamine in this increasingly depressing world. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2226280/extras/32728